{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31324","headline":"下第归宜春酬黄颇饯别 · 潘唐","name":"下第归宜春酬黄颇饯别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代澄清雨露均，独怀惆怅出咸秦。\n承明未荐相如赋，故国犹惭季子贫。\n御苑钟声临远水，都门树色背行尘。\n一从此地曾携手，益羡江头桃李春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}